/*
 * Implements semantic validation for template arguments, template calls,
 * template specialization checks, and multi-symbol template dispatch.
 *
 * This module is responsible for:
 *
 *   - validating template argument lists(as types or compile-time values),
 *   - validating template call expressions,
 *   - performing template specialization checks(`template checker`),
 *   - resolving multi-symbol template calls with scoring and finalization,
 *   - rewriting template references into concrete symbols or delegates.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::template_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/template_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-26
